# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

@SmartXApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7031

### Float telemetry
POST {{SmartXApi_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/float
Content-Type: application/json

{
"deviceId": "ESP32-0001",
"metric": "Temperature",
"value": 29.4,
"unit": "°C"
}

### Integer telemetry
POST {{SmartXApi_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/int
Content-Type: application/json

{
"deviceId": "ESP32-0002",
"metric": "PowerWattage",
"value": 2100,
"unit": "W"
}

### Boolean telemetry
POST {{SmartXApi_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/bool
Content-Type: application/json

{
"deviceId": "ESP32-0003",
"metric": "ValveState",
"value": false,
"unit": "State"
}

